# Arch Linux Archive snapshot the image (and the build distro) install from:
#   https://archive.archlinux.org/repos/$ARCH_SNAPSHOT/$repo/os/$arch
# Checked 2026-11-14 against extra.db/core.db of this date: the first snapshot with Arch's
# hyprland 0.56.2-4 (linux/packages/ref/hyprland.PKGBUILD) and aquamarine 0.15.1-1, so the
# Hypr libraries are the ones Arch built Hyprland v0.56.2 / aquamarine v0.15.1 against:
#   hyprutils 0.14.2-1 (libhyprutils.so.13), hyprlang 0.6.8-5, hyprcursor 0.1.13-7,
#   hyprgraphics 0.5.1-4, hyprwire 0.3.1-3, hyprland-guiutils 0.2.2-4, glaze 9.0.0-1,
#   hyprwayland-scanner 0.4.6-1, hyprland-protocols 0.7.1-1, llvm-libs 23.1.1-1.
# (extra has mesa 26.2.4-1 here; [womarchy]'s mesa 26.2.3-2.x wins because the repo comes first.)
# Moving it: check those versions again and rebuild hyprland/aquamarine/mesa on the new date.
ARCH_SNAPSHOT=2026/10/03
